{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxPicker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A picker allowing to expose several checkboxes and select some of them within the others."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Each checkbox contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"The picker will expose the choosen values using this “tag”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (divider, read only and error mode, layout and outlined)"}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCheckboxPicker"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents18OUDSCheckboxPickerV","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","deprecated":false}],"symbolKind":"struct","title":"OUDSCheckboxPicker","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"OUDSCheckboxPicker","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscheckboxpicker"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declaratio